  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Highlights in this release:\n- Added support for HTTP/1.1 chunked response encoding, enabling dynamic content delivery without pre-calculating Content-Length.\n- Added HttpResponseStream: A zero-allocation, reusable Stream implementation for writing chunked bodies.\n- Added new WriteAsync overloads to HttpResponseWriter for seamless integration with chunked responses.\n- Optimized performance for streaming scenarios with dedicated benchmarks showing zero-allocation steady state.\n- Expanded test coverage with comprehensive unit and integration tests for chunked encoding and streaming.",
